"""
solution.py

Solution to the Fibonacci Sequence challenge for Google FooBar.

In this challenge, I implement a memoized version of Fibonacci, and
return the last digit of 40000000000. The last digit of 40000000000 is
known as a Fibonacci number, and is 535.

